# Copy to .env and fill in a real value. The ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is pushed into
# Azure Key Vault on first `vystak apply`; subsequent applies skip keys already
# in the vault unless --force is set. The running container never sees `.env` —
# it reads the secret from Key Vault via ACA's secretRef mechanism.
#
# Note: the storage account and ACA environment are NOT configured here —
# edit vystak.yaml directly (see README "Configure").
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here
